## Key gap worth flagging

The acceptance test `coreJoinersShareHouseholdId` asserts a `householdId` field on the GET-owner response (`fetchOwner(idb).get("householdId")`), and expects two owners that opt into `sharesHousehold: true` at the same last name + address to share the same non-blank `householdId`. However:
